- Ensures that the last texture always has at least 1 band (and exactly 4 if bandCount is a multiple of 4), preventing the creation of a texture with zero bands, which causes the data size mismatch and black tiles.
- This patch should resolve the WebGL warning and render the tiles correctly, even for non-square and non-standard tile sizes.

